    "claim": "the land use choice under one principle can be written as a goal program",
    "support_steps": [
     "keep the total area fixed",
     "cap the spending by the budget",
     "minimize the deviations from the two minimums"
    ],
    "decision_consequence": "judge a province's plan by where it sits against the program",
